sentences.text:
Accordingly, the petitioner is enlarged on bail of Rs. 50,000/- with one local surety of the like amount to the satisfaction the learned CJM, Morigaon, subject to condition that :
i. the petitioner shall make himself available before the I.O. as and when so required ;
ii. The petitioner shall not interfere with the investigation in any manner and shall not intimidate any person connected with this case.

opennyai_summary.decision:
Accordingly, the petitioner is enlarged on bail of Rs. 50,000/- with one local surety of the like amount to the satisfaction the learned CJM, Morigaon, subject to condition that :
i. the petitioner shall make himself available before the I.O. as and when so required ;
ii. The petitioner shall not interfere with the investigation in any manner and shall not intimidate any person connected with this case.
iii. The petitioner shall not leave the territorial jurisdiction of concerned Police Station without obtaining prior written permission from the Court, till completion of investigation;
Return the C.D.
The bail application is disposed of.

